# Check out LF everywhere, including on Windows.
#
# Without this, git's autocrlf gives a Windows checkout CRLF endings, the
# formatter reads every file as misformatted, and `format:check` fails on all
# of them — which is exactly how the first Windows CI run failed, on 238 files
# it had no other complaint about.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, so never touched.
*.png binary
*.icns binary
*.ico binary
*.node binary

# The landing page's demo clips and their posters. Without these, `* text=auto`
# above is the only thing standing between a Windows checkout and a corrupted
# video, and git's autodetection is not something to bet a silent 0-byte asset
# on -- one was served to production as a 200 during this work.
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
